.TH OMARCHY\-FAN 1 "2026" "omarchy-fan" "ThinkPad Fan Control"
.SH NAME
omarchy\-fan \- the old name of omarchyfan (deprecated)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B omarchy\-fan
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B omarchy\-fan
is the former name, with a hyphen, of the
.BR omarchyfan (1)
command. It still works: it takes the same arguments and does exactly the same thing, and it prints a notice (only
when run in a terminal) that the name is old.
.PP
.B It will be removed in a future release.
Use
.B omarchyfan
instead, and change any scripts that call the old name.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR omarchyfan (1)
